    "content": "The 2026 tax filing season (for 2025 tax returns) begins on Monday, January 26, 2026, when the IRS officially starts accepting and processing returns. The deadline to file your tax return or request an extension is Wednesday, April 15, 2026. Taxpayers can use IRS Free File starting January 9 for qualified filers. IRS Free File Key 2026 Tax Deadlines: January 26, 2026: IRS begins accepting electronic tax returns. February 2, 2026: Deadline for employers to provide W-2s and 1099s. April 15, 2026: Tax Day (Individual return deadline). April 15, 2026: Deadline to file Form 4868 to request an automatic 6-month extension. Form 4868 October 15, 2026: Extension deadline for filing 2025 returns. For most, electronic filing with direct deposit is the fastest method, with refunds usually issued in less than three weeks.",
